Package: DataAudit
Type: Package
Title: Data Audit and Multilevel Reliability Tools for jamovi
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Christian Higton
Maintainer: Christian Higton <christian.higton@gmail.com>
Description: Produces a teaching-friendly data audit and codebook for jamovi
    datasets, including variable type inference, missing-data summaries,
    data-quality flags, descriptives, optional assumption screening, and
    within-person and between-person reliability analysis.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jmvcore (>= 0.8.5), lavaan (>= 0.6-15), R6
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
